  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MPTF. Support to UN Migration Fund. 2023-2025.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implement the Global Compact for Safe, Orderly and Regular Migration (GCM) through the MPTF by helping more people better along migratory routes and thereby preventing refugees and irregular migrants from ending up in vulnerable situations and being subjected to inhumane treatment and harassment. Strengthening cooperation with countries to enable them to handle irregular migration in accordance with human rights. Strengthening the capacity of developing countries to manage their borders according to a rights-based approach, providing protection and handling irregular migration.</narrative>
  </description>
